OL,3,GNEWSAWatchdog warns Scotland's colleges
OL,4,Aface increasing financial pressure
OL,5,
OL,6,FFinancial pressures on Scotland's
OL,7,Fcolleges are increasing, a watchdog has
OL,8,Fwarned, with the further education
OL,9,Fsector reporting a deficit for the
OL,10,Fthird year in a row.
OL,12,FA new report said the country's 19
OL,13,Fcolleges had an overall deficit of
OL,14,F#5.6m in 2024-25, up from #1.9m in the
OL,15,Fprevious 12 months.
OL,17,FThe worsening financial situation was
OL,18,Fsaid to be the result of increasing
OL,19,Fcosts - including staff and energy -
OL,20,Fnot being matched by increases in
OL,21,Ffunding.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
