OL,3,GNEWSAWatchdog warns Scotland's colleges
OL,4,Aface increasing financial pressure
OL,5,
OL,6,FPublic spending watchdog Audit Scotland
OL,7,Fsaid funding to colleges had decreased
OL,8,Fby more than 7% in real terms in the
OL,9,Ffive years to 2026-27.
